  "name": null,
  "problem": "Dana surveys $72$ randomly chosen students at her school, asking them if they have gerbils or rabbits at home. Her findings are summarized in the two-way frequency table below.\n\n|  | Has a rabbit | Doesn't have a rabbit | Totals |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Has a gerbil | $18$ | $12$ | $30$ |\n| Doesn't have a gerbil | $6$ | $36$ | $42$ |\n| Totals | $24$ | $48$ | $72$ |\n\nEstimate the probability that a randomly chosen student at the school has a gerbil and also has a rabbit.",
